---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | instabid.live" description="Learn about instabid.live - the verified pay-to-rank Instagram attention marketplace.">
  <article class="clay-box p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 my-4 sm:my-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4 sm:space-y-6">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 sm:px-3 sm:py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold bg-pink-500/10 text-pink-600">
      📸 OUR MISSION
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">About instabid.live</h1>

    <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        <strong>instabid.live</strong> was founded with a single core goal: to build the most transparent, trustworthy, and high-converting paid attention marketplace specifically designed for Instagram creators and digital brands.
      </p>
      <p>
        Unlike legacy link directory experiments that allowed unverified users to buy rank for any handle without proof of ownership, instabid.live pioneers verified account listing. Through our automated Bio Challenge Verification, we ensure that every single bidder on our platform is the genuine owner of the Instagram profile being promoted.
      </p>
      <p>
        Operating on 7-day weekly category seasons, instabid.live empowers creators in Fashion, Fitness, Memes, Tech, Music, and Web3 to compete fairly for top profile visibility and drive verified human traffic to their Instagram accounts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
